        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $('If').item.json.Name }}  \n\nWhen a roofing enquiry comes in and nobody follows up quickly, that homeowner moves on to the next roofer. The lead was there but it was not converted, and every unconverted lead is direct revenue walking out the door. \n\nI built an AI system that follows up with every enquiry instantly, qualifies the lead, and books the appointment automatically so that does not happen.  \n\nI have a demo ready if you want to see it.  \n\nAhmad \nVornexia",
